{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Logic.Relation","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.List.Basic"],"declarations":39,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.perm_s1_s2_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.perm_s1_s2_ne","kind":"theorem","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/BorromeanBraidPure.lean#L208-L211","doc":"The two transpositions do not commute, so `permOfWord` is not a\nhomomorphism to an abelian group and the invariance above is not vacuous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.borromean_not_halfTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.borromean_not_halfTwist","kind":"theorem","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/BorromeanBraidPure.lean#L200-L206","doc":"No half-twist is equal in `B₃` to the Borromean braid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.expSum_conj_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.expSum_conj_gen","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/BorromeanBraidPure.lean#L193-L198","doc":"A half-twist — any conjugate `c g c⁻¹` of a single letter — has exponent\nsum `±1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.expSum_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.expSum_single","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/BorromeanBraidPure.lean#L188-L191","doc":"A single generator has exponent sum `±1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.borromean_expSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.borromean_expSum","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/BorromeanBraidPure.lean#L184-L186","doc":"(ii) The exponent sum of `(σ₁ σ₂⁻¹)³` is `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.borromean_equiv_perm_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.borromean_equiv_perm_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/BorromeanBraidPure.lean#L178-L182","doc":"Hence every word equal to it in `B₃` has trivial `S₃`-image: the\nBorromean braid is pure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.borromean_perm_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.borromean_perm_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/BorromeanBraidPure.lean#L174-L176","doc":"(i) The `S₃`-image of `(σ₁ σ₂⁻¹)³` is the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.expSum_braidEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.BorromeanBraidPure.expSum_braidEq","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightf